  "root_cause": "The compact-hop interpretation and side-five implementation boundary are repaired. The attempted beta construction from the reduced tau/W configuration projector is mathematically impossible: that scalar-vector Hodge chart is one chiral Cl(3) representation and its beta anticommutant has dimension zero. Retaining all eight cube cochain degrees exactly restores corner-parity beta and two closed rank-four copies with zero Clifford defects. A literal one-update cell jump is strongly obstructed. Spreading the same translation over 64 updates improves its DEL residual by more than three orders of magnitude and reaches the exact shifted endpoint, but it is still not a free orbit. Reversal decomposition shows that the dominant remaining residual is even in direction, almost entirely chi, and almost perfectly aligned with the canonical V40 kinetic term. The existing orientation and symplectic connections contribute mainly to the much smaller odd response. The rest-shaped chi mold therefore cannot simply slide; a moving solution must develop a native velocity-dependent chi deformation or traveling tail whose spatial force balances its inertia.",
